graphify-out

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Carlos Office local integration configuration and OAuth/session material
Back/mcp.config.json
Back/mcp.monitors.json
Back/.google-workspace-mcp/
Back/.mcp-auth/
Back/.runtime/

# Diagnostic reports (https://nodejs.org/api/report.html)
report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json

# Runtime data and private Obsidian records
pids
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
# Legacy fact storage was replaced by the tracked 10-Knowledge/Facts.md file.
Back/ObsidianVault/15-Memory/
Back/ObsidianVault/20-Agents/
Back/ObsidianVault/00-Inbox/
# Chat history and generated artifacts are local/private regardless of their
# legacy or current subfolder layout. Durable project specifications belong in
# Back/artifacts instead of the runtime vault.
Back/ObsidianVault/30-Conversations/
Back/ObsidianVault/40-Jobs/
Back/ObsidianVault/45-Tasks/
Back/ObsidianVault/50-Artifacts/
# Agent scratch files now default to OS temporary storage. Keep the legacy
# vault workspace and every vault archive local-only during migration.
Back/ObsidianVault/60-Workspace/
Back/ObsidianVault/90-System/Archive/
Back/ObsidianVault/**/Archive/
Back/ObsidianVault/**/archive/
/archive/
# Runtime captures, MCP audit records, retention directives, and migration
# receipts stay local. Active agent configuration is the only tracked runtime
# subtree so newly added agents remain version-controlled.
Back/ObsidianVault/90-System/Runtime/**
!Back/ObsidianVault/90-System/Runtime/Agents/
!Back/ObsidianVault/90-System/Runtime/Agents/*.md
Back/ObsidianVault/90-System/Runtime/Agents/.Migrations/

